1. kubernetes-network-driver-basic (Apache License 2.0)
Original repository: https://github.com/aojea/kubernetes-network-driver-basic
The following files were originally copied from this project and subsequently modified to adapt them for SDR devices:
- pkg/driver/driver.go: Modified to implement SDR-specific logic (IP and USB handling) instead of basic networking.
- cmd/dra-driver-ettus-sdr/main.go: Modified to include SDR-specific initialization and firmware copying.
- deployments/manifests/install.yaml: Modified to define SDR DeviceClasses and Roles.
- deployments/container/Dockerfile: Modified from the original multi-stage build to include UHD drivers and tools.
- Makefile: Modified build targets and tag generation logic.

2. dra-example-driver (Apache License 2.0)
Original repository: https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/dra-example-driver
The following file was originally copied from this project and modified to adapt for SDR devices:
- pkg/cdi/cdi.go: Modified to generate CDI specifications tailored for SDR USB devices.
